        "id": "node-1792685040178",
        "instruction": {
          "text": "Ask: \"Can you take a message?\" If they agree, ask them to let John Doe know that Nancy from Alpha Bank called and would like a call back. Do not mention a debt, a balance, or why you are calling. Thank them.",
